----- stdout -----
Install or update a MoonBit toolchain

Usage: moonup install [OPTIONS] [TOOLCHAIN]

Arguments:
  [TOOLCHAIN]
          Toolchain version or channel name
          
          Channels are data: whatever the dist server advertises is installable. See `moonup install --list-available` for the available channels.

Options:
  -l, --list-available
          List available channels or versions
          
          If `toolchain` is not specified, this will list all available channels. If `toolchain` is specified, this will list all available versions for that toolchain's channel.

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase logging verbosity

  -q, --quiet...
          Decrease logging verbosity

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

